Subject: [PATCH] Parallel entity tracker

Derived from Petal's multithreaded tracker; rewritten into a three-phase
scan/apply/send model with join barriers.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/server/level/ChunkMap.java b/net/minecraft/server/level/ChunkMap.java
index 130333d0a11acd9955223613f8deb6efcd1001b8..bb64dc7a42f7aed36654e46f62198eec8c64628e 100644
